Method	URI	Action	Purpose
GET	/users	index	List all users
GET	/users/create	create	Show form to create user
POST	/users	store	Create a new user
GET	/users/{id}	show	Show one user
GET	/users/{id}/edit	edit	Show form to edit user
PUT/PATCH	/users/{id}	update	Update user
DELETE	/users/{id}	destroy	Delete user
